Vault.OS live medium (Arch Linux derivative).

  vaultos status
  vaultos doctor
  vaultos-install    # refuses unless you type: INSTALL TO /dev/DISK CONFIRMED

This ISO will not partition a disk without that exact confirmation.
Do not run the installer against a machine that is already booted from its HDD.

Wi-Fi: iwctl. After network: vaultos-install with a target disk you intend to wipe.
